<title>USA: Trinova Corp Q1 net off after charge.</title>
<headline>Trinova Corp Q1 net off after charge.</headline>
<dateline>MAUMEE, Ohio 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.20		    $0.83</p>
<p> Net			  5,700		   24,400</p>
<p> Revs		     538,400		  512,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q1 1997 operating net was $24.2 million, or $0.86 per share, excluding a $30 million charge, or $0.66 per share, from exiting the automotive interior plastics business.</p>
<p>First Call estimate for Q1 1997 was $0.76.  </p>
<p>Q1 1996 results include a reseach-and-development tax credit of $4.0 million, or $0.13 per share.</p>
</text>
